    "claims_refuted_and_conceded": {
      "lead_and_tin_in_odyssey": "Permanently conceded in Round 1. Re-verified by everyone; Homer uses *boos keras* instead of *molybdaina* in Od. 12, and *kassiteros* has 0 occurrences.",
